<title>INDONESIA: Bank Indonesia drains 31 bln rupiah temporarily.</title>
<headline>Bank Indonesia drains 31 bln rupiah temporarily.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's central bank, Bank Indonesia, drained some 31 billion rupiah temporarily from the money market early on Thursday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The withdrawal was done through some 206 billion rupiah of short-term securities (SBPUs) due today and 100 billion rupiah of weekly central bank certificates (SBIs) to be settled today against some 275 billion rupiah of maturing SBIs.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom 6221-3846364</p>
